  "description": "Even though he’s built like a fighter with a fearsome scowl, Hwang Jae-Ho would love nothing more than to become a florist instead. Unfortunately, Jae-Ho’s overbearing father disapproves, pushing his son to become an MMA fighter instead. Jae-Ho enters the virtual reality game, New World, to escape his father’s ambitions, but will he be able to realize his dreams? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
